          "text": "- **Path traversal in identifier handling** — validated identifiers before they reach team/session joins and closed the parent path-traversal surface. (PRs [#1658](https://github.com/Yeachan-Heo/oh-my-codex/pull/1658), [#1674](https://github.com/Yeachan-Heo/oh"
        },
